invalid type: string "SYMPTOMS: generalized weakness, fatigue, malaise, reduced activity\n\nOVERVIEW\nWeakness and fatigue can be caused by infections, chronic disease, dehydration, or other causes.\n\nWHAT TO DO\n- Rest, hydrate, seek care if sudden severe weakness, difficulty walking, or associated chest pain.\n- Consider outpatient review for persistent fatigue lasting weeks.\n\nWARNING SIGNS\n